CorvCAD patch series for KiCad 10.0.6 (caf7377), on top of 0007: let the headless board slice
compile against the wxWidgets iOS port (osx_iphone), as 0002 does for the schematic slice.

Applied by integrations/kicad_core/fetch.py. Desktop behaviour is unchanged.

1. Layer-name matching in pcbexpr_evaluator.cpp, pcbexpr_functions.cpp and drc_rule_parser.cpp
   reads wxPGChoices through GetLabel(i)/GetValue(i) instead of wxPGChoiceEntry, which the
   property-grid-less fallback (properties/pg_choices_fallback.h) does not have.
2. board_item.cpp and pcbnew_settings.cpp drop an unused <pybind11/pybind11.h> include.
3. ogl_attr_list.h declares OGL_ATT_LIST only when wx has a GL canvas; the 3D viewer settings
   only need ANTIALIASING_MODE.
4. PCB_EDIT_FRAME::ExportSpecctraFile() and ::ImportSpecctraSession() move from
   specctra_export.cpp and specctra_import.cpp to a new specctra_frame.cpp (listed in
   pcbnew/CMakeLists.txt), so the DSN exporter and SES importer build without the editor.
